{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07527","headline":"咏陶渊明 · 颜真卿","name":"咏陶渊明","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"张良思报韩，龚胜耻事新。\n狙击不肯就，舍生悲缙绅。\n呜呼陶渊明，奕叶爲晋臣。\n自以公相後，每怀宗国屯。\n题诗庚子岁，自谓羲皇人。\n手持山海经，头戴漉酒巾。\n兴逐孤云外，心随还鸟泯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"颜真卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07527.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07527","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}